{"_id":"6a2ff5152204ffbc59e5a5ce","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"ACr__YweG2xOAf56FK8tE","description":"# Reshaping\n\nReshaping transforms the structure of a DataFrame without changing its data. `pivot()` and `pivot_table()` convert long-format data to wide format. `melt()` does the reverse, converting wide to long. `stack()` and `unstack()` move index levels to columns or vice versa. Reshaping is often needed to prepare data for specific visualizations or models.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Reshaping and pivot tables","url":"https://pandas.pydata.org/docs/user_guide/reshaping.html","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aec01"},{"type":"article","title":"Reshaping a Pandas Dataframe: Long-to-Wide and Vice Versa","url":"https://towardsdatascience.com/reshaping-a-pandas-dataframe-long-to-wide-and-vice-versa-517c7f0995ad/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aec02"},{"type":"video","title":"Pandas - Reshape Dataframe","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oY62o-tBHF4&list=PL6icxsSf2sRe2qqFmtZwU_VKChEChzhEP","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aec03"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:50:29.969Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/ACr__YweG2xOAf56FK8tE.md"}